cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AssetForge
message: If you use AssetForge in your work, please cite this repository.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Task synthesis for business-automation agents. AssetForge compiles a business area and a set
  of reusable construction assets into executable, scoreable tasks through a four-stage
  pipeline: (Assets + Rubrics) -> Author -> Gate -> Reviewer -> QA.
authors:
  - name: AssetForge contributors
